          "text": "INVOICE No. BW-2026-0412\nBrightwater Office Supplies Ltd\nIssue date: 2026-10-02   Due date: 2026-11-01\nA4 paper, 20 reams ........ 180.00\nToner cartridges, 4 ....... 220.00\nSubtotal 400.00 EUR  VAT 21% 84.00\nTotal due: 484.00 EUR"
